# Lock-in fixture for the P14.20 CODEOWNERS regex fix (2026-05-19).
#
# This file contains ONLY extension-specific rules (`*.go`, `*.rs`).
# None of them cover `.github/workflows/*.yml`. With the previous
# `^\s*\*` pattern, the scanner would see the `*.go` line, treat
# its leading `*` as a global catch-all owner, and conclude that
# workflows ARE covered — silently suppressing P14.20 across the
# whole fixtures dir.
#
# Scanner expectation: P14.20 still fires once (the fixtures dir has
# no entry that actually covers `.github/workflows/`). With the bug
# present, the EXPECTED_COUNTS manifest would drop P14.20 from 1 to 0
# and the test fails.

*.go @sec-team
*.rs @sec-team
